  "title": "Best Madeleines (French Butter Cakes)",
  "description": "Use this recipe for madeleines and follow along with the video to make these beautiful sponge cake French cookies baked in special shell-shaped molds.",
  "authors": [
    "Judy Farris"
  ],
  "date_published": "2008-06-30T19:10:59-04:00",
